  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JP Driving Climate Resilience and Nature-Positive Growth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint Programme (JP) for Ghana, across both phases, aims to catalyze the transition to sustainable, resilient, and equitable food systems through innovative financing and nature-positive soybean value chain development. The JP will pilot and scale climate-smart production, circular processing, nutrition-sensitive procurement, and policy alignment&#x2014;enabling 10,000+ youth and women to engage in green agribusiness, improving dietary diversity for 1 million+ schoolchildren, and restoring 10,000+</narrative>
  </description>
